Q) Write context free grammar for L = {ab, aabb, aaabbb, ........}  
Sol:  
G = (V,T,P,S)  
T = {a,b} 
V = {S} 
S=S  
P: S —>ab  
S—>aSb  
Q) Write CFG for  
L = {∈, a, b, aa, ab, ba, bb, aaa, aab, ......}  
Sol:  
G = (V,T,P,S)  
V = {S}  
T = { a, b }  
S=S  
P:  
S—>∈  
S—>aS 
S—>bS  
Q) Write CFG for L = (a+b)* aa (a+b)* 
L = {aa, aaaa, aaab, baaa, baab, .......}  
Sol: 
G = (V,T,P,S)  
V = { S, A } 
 T = { a, b } 
 S=S  
P:  
S—>AaaA  
A—>aA  
A—>bA

